 "text": "Hello, how are you doing? That's doable. A cheap bag of rice cheese and bread gives you snacks, a pot for the rice and cheese, and a couple of bowls. Fair. A plastic tub in the fridge is enough to keep it cool. Cancelled is good news. Most places can reschedule. You' welcome. Find a spot in the sun for a couple of hours each day, or lean it against the side of a building in the shade. A big metal container like a jar works too. Just keep it moving.",
